# Insect (NSECT) - the weakest, fastest monster (bestiary species).
#
# A small, very fast, relentlessly aggressive biter. Always solo. It just chases the
# nearest ship at high throttle and nips one bite per pass. Low health, small look.
# The reference-simplicity species: no custom brain, no damage/reactive mechanic -
# it exists to prove the pattern and to be a cheap swarmless nuisance.
# role("monster") umbrella + role("insect") scoping. NON-TYPHON: it rides the monster5
# hull on behav_npcship, so MONSTER_NON_TYPHON can switch it off.
=== prefab_insect
metadata: ```
type: prefab/monster
side: monster
name: ""
health: 1500
scale: 0.5
brain:
    - label: ai_chase_player
      data:
        SIZE_X: 16000
        throttle: 3.2
        force_shoot: true
    - label: ai_chase_npc
      data:
        SIZE_X: 16000
        throttle: 3.2
        force_shoot: true
```
    # Non-Typhon species - the host can switch these off (MONSTER_NON_TYPHON,
    # declared in __init__.mast). Yields 0, never ->END or None; see the note there.
    yield result 0 if not MONSTER_NON_TYPHON
    monster = npc_spawn(START_X, START_Y, START_Z, name, side + ",monster,insect", "monster5", "behav_npcship")
    monster.blob.set("monster_health_max", health, 0)
    monster.blob.set("monster_health", health, 0)
    monster.blob.set("local_scale_coeff", scale, 0)
    monster.engine_object.exclusion_radius = int(200 * scale)

    # Look (geometry + colours) comes from the monster5 art now.

    clear_target(monster.id)
    brain_add(monster, brain)
    yield result to_id(monster)


# Science scan - a fast but weak nuisance; not a real threat alone.
//enable/science if has_role(SCIENCE_SELECTED_ID, "insect")
//science if has_role(SCIENCE_SELECTED_ID, "insect")

    + "scan":
        <scan>
            % HOSTILE: NSECT - a small, extremely fast lifeform. Aggressive but weak.
            % HOSTILE: NSECT - a space bug; it stings for little damage and must circle for each pass. More nuisance than danger.
            % HOSTILE: NSECT - a lone specimen is easily destroyed. Watch it does not harass you into a worse threat.
